  claims=[claim('repair-1','A concrete cross-account handoff was accepted and implemented through the supplied commit.', 'observation',ix(1,2,3,5,6),ix(4),'Opus changed from an initially announced empty commit to the new-branch/cherry-pick route already offered by GPT-5.2. The cause of the account restriction is unknown.'),claim('repair-2','CI success was checked by a third agent, while a separate deployment failure remained.', 'observation',ix(7,8),[],'A successful CI run is not deployment success. This is a recorded CLI result, not a present-day GitHub audit.'),claim('repair-3','The later gitlink repair was committed and reported merged; a subsequent Pages workflow succeeded and the requester checked the gitlink was absent.', 'observation',ix(9,10,11,12),ix(8),'Temporal sequence plus matching artifact references support this bounded repair. They do not measure causal improvement from cooperation or prove all site functionality.'),claim('repair-4','The sequence is consistent with successful task coordination under access and repository-state obstacles.', 'interpretation',ix(2,3,5,6,7,9,10,11),ix(4,8),'Selected success case with no comparison condition; concurrent work and other unreviewed changes may contribute.')]
  assessments=[assessment('C1','present','sufficient','consistent','Actor: Claude Opus 4.5. GPT-5.2 supplies a concrete commit and asks for another account to publish it; Opus accepts, cherry-picks, and obtains a PR receipt. The specified contribution is tool-reported and inspectable.',ix(2,3,5,6),'One accepted contribution: re-publish the provided fix for CI; assessed through the PR82 receipt, not every repair action.'),assessment('C3','present','sufficient','consistent','Actor: Claude Opus 4.5 as recipient. The observed action retains the specified fix and authorship and follows the requester’s offered new-branch workaround after an existing-PR error.',ix(2,3,4,5,6),'One explicit handoff from GPT-5.2 to Opus; bundled requirements form one opportunity.'),assessment('C4','uncertain','partial','not_assessable','The peer promises help, but no explicit deadline or agreed closure rule is established in these anchors. Completion evidence is reported descriptively without inventing a timed commitment criterion.',ix(3,6,7),'One candidate commitment; no eligible timed commitment denominator established.'),assessment('C5','uncertain','partial','not_assessable','Independent command checks are visible, but the recommendation-linked decision and all actor-available evidence needed for a reliance-calibration judgment are not established.',ix(7,8,11,12),'Candidate checking behavior only; no independently assessable reliance opportunity counted.'),assessment('C6','uncertain','partial','not_assessable','Repair actions follow error reports, but these selected anchors do not establish a distinct disputed belief plus an independently validated social correction and recipient exposure. Do not equate successful debugging with a scored correction episode.',ix(4,8,9,12),'No eligible social-correction denominator established in this packet.')]
